OL,3,AUK military jamming other nations'
OL,4,Asatellites to defend itself, BBC told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British military has been jamming
OL,7,For blocking satellites from other
OL,8,Fcountries in order to defend itself
OL,9,Ffrom hostile threats, the BBC has been
OL,10,Ftold.
OL,12,FThe RAF has been using a ground-based
OL,13,Fsystem for the past year, which a
OL,14,Fdefence source said had already been
OL,15,Fused "to deter our adversaries".
OL,17,FIt is understood the system could be
OL,18,Fused to prevent a hostile nation's
OL,19,Fsatellites from tracking the movement
OL,20,Fof the UK's nuclear armed submarines or
OL,21,Fother sensitive military operations,
OL,22,Fsuch as those involving special forces.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
