OL,3,AWhite House rolling out red carpet for
OL,4,Ahistoric Xi Jinping visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump will host
OL,7,FChinese leader Xi Jinping this week in
OL,8,FWashington, with AI, trade and Taiwan
OL,9,Fexpected to be on the agenda for the
OL,10,Fleaders of the global superpowers.
OL,12,FXi will be greeted personally by Trump
OL,13,Fat Andrews Air Force Base on the eve of
OL,14,Fa White House state dinner and a
OL,15,Fmilitary flyover.
OL,17,FThe three-day trip marks Xi's first
OL,18,Fstate visit to the US since 2015 and
OL,19,Fhis third meeting with Trump in the
OL,20,Fpast year.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
